# seq-sounds -- W5-E2 (R-133): the art "<Seq>Sounds= frame sound" tail
# [RE: FUN_00523A30 / FUN_00520810]. No Allied/Soviet soldier uses it; the
# YR T-Rex (DNOA, TrexSequence WalkSounds= 2 TrexFoot) does.
set render_every 300
set on_quit continue
click button "Single Player"
click button Skirmish
click start
until 90 scene == game
click unit 0:AMCV
key d
until 450 built(0,GACNST) == 1
cheat spawn DNOA 0 building 0:GACNST +4 +4
wait 2
require units(0,DNOA) == 1
click unit 0:DNOA
click unit 0:DNOA +6 +2
until 200 why(sequence_sound) >= 1                       @R-133:E
assert snd(TrexFoot) >= 1                                @R-133:E
end
